  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3102.07 Attainment demonstration",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3102.07 \"Attainment demonstration\" means \"attainment demonstration\" as defined in RSA 125-J:1,IV, namely a demonstration that \"emissions reductions required to satisfy reasonable further progress (\"RFP\") and attainment of national ambient air quality standards (\"NAAQS\") under the Act\" are sufficient.\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3100.html"
}
